    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Order of Panch Prayag from upstream to downstream: Vishnuprayag, Nandaprayag, Karnaprayag, Rudraprayag, and Devprayag.",
        "Devprayag is the confluence of Bhagirathi and Alaknanda where the river takes the official name 'Ganga'.",
        "Lipulekh pass is frequently asked in competitive exams due to its role in the Kailash Mansarovar Yatra route."
      ],
      "id": "cpmgpdi"
    },
